      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Contract\n\ndata.trigger selects sourceNodeId or sourceClassKey, eventKey and optional sourceRef/bridgeNodeId; data.enabled controls availability. Legacy methodNodeId and subscription encodings are compatibility inputs, not new authoring shape."
        },
