      "data": {
        "content": {
          "kind": "markdown",
          "value": "# Behavior\n\n## Implemented behavior\n\neventHandlerContract resolves the ordered Methods; eventBridge and bridgeEventSubscriptions resolve emitter contracts and cross-graph delivery. Change announcements use the central write paths. Event Handler and Method cards are edit-mode infrastructure while their execution can remain active in browse mode.\n\n## Known gaps\n\nAGENTS.md names the action-method socket while the plan named invokes as the edge class; both refer to different parts of the same connection. Cross-graph runtime smoke results must be recorded separately from schema checks.\n\n## Open decisions\n\nNo additional decision is required to describe the behavior above. Changes to that contract require an explicit task; implementation gaps are not implied approvals.\n\n## Evidence\n\nSource (twilite repository):\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/eventHandlerContract.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/eventBridge.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/bridgeEventSubscriptions.js`\n- `components/GraphEditor/utils/nodeVisibilityRoles.js`\n\nFocused tests (twilite repository):\n- `tests/eventHandlerContract.test.js`\n- `tests/bridgeEventModel.test.js`\n\nThese pointers identify evidence to inspect. Structural validation does not prove runtime or browser behavior."
        },
        "interfaceContract": {
          "version": 1,
          "receivesViewContent": true
        },
        "identity": {
          "graphId": "primitive-event-handler",
          "nodeId": "event-handler-behavior"
        }
      }
    },
